  "citation": "Kaiser D P (1999): Trends in Total Cloud Amount Over China (1951 - 1994). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.008",
  "dataset": {
